      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Maze Escape\n\nA simple offline browser game built with HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript.\n\n## How to Play\n\n- Use the **arrow keys** to move the player (yellow square) through the maze.\n- Walls (dark squares) block movement.\n- Reach the green exit square to win.\n- The step counter tracks how many moves you've made.\n- Click **Restart** to reset the game.\n\n## Features\n\n- 7x7 fixed maze layout\n- Keyboard controls with arrow keys\n- Step counter\n- Win message \"You escaped!\"\n- Restart button\n- Responsive design down to 360px wide\n- Accessible focus states and labeled controls\n\n## Setup\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. No server or network required.",
